      "rendered": "<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"1505\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2016/08/27/c0ncrete-007-with-license-to-kill/material_176/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/material_176.png?fit=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"800,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_176\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/material_176.png?fit=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1505 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/material_176.png?resize=800%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"concrete wall\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"1505\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2016/08/27/c0ncrete-007-with-license-to-kill/material_176/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/material_176.png?fit=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"800,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_176\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/material_176.png?fit=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1505 size-full lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20800%20800%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"concrete wall\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/material_176.png\"></p>\n<p>Seamless texture, 1024&nbsp;x 1024, with the following maps:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Diffuse</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Specularity</li>\n<li>Ambient Occlusion</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12hnNFP4MtuQim6GfWVyw2PVy5kDfWydr?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOWNLOAD ALL THE MAPS</a></p>\n<p>As always it’s a free texture, you can do whatever you want with it. Just don’t be a prick a tell it’s yours.</p>\n<p>If you like my work and you find it good enough to use on your work, consider giving me a small tip using the right&nbsp;menu and in return I’ll provide you a link to the folder where I have all my textures and you can download them all with a single click.</p>\n<p>Take care and be around, I’ll be posting more soon.</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://3dtextures.me/texture-pack-volume-1/\">Checkout my pack with 100 seamless textures + maps!</a></h2>\n",
